Not doing those things won't lower your dexterity. However, there are
things you can actually *do* that "abuse" your dexterity (the opposite of
excercising).

The most common way to abuse your dexterity is walking around *satiated*.
This will gradually lower your dexterity.

> YANI: why in the world should the player know looking
