I believe it has something to do with the way the level generator
currently works. There is no way to tell it "if item X is generated, don't
generate item Y". You can only specify both items or one of them, with a
chance of generation per item. So if you'd specify both of them with a 50%
chance, you wouldn't get either, but you might also get both or none.

